		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Beneath the Nether’s scorched skies and crimson stone lies an ancient secret-&lResource vents&r of unimaginable power. Two such marvels-&4Scorchia&r and &8Ancient Debris&r vents-await discovery by those brave enough to tread the Nether’s perilous heights."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Once found, these vents hold the key to automating two of the most valuable resources:"
				""
				"When activated, these volcanic veins unleash a molten core ready to be tapped by &lCreate's mechanical extruders&r. Feed them the correct milkshake or molten fluid, and you’ll gain a constant supply of some of Minecraft’s most coveted materials."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&c Caution: The Nether is a volatile realm. You’ll need careful planning, heat protection, and sharp reflexes to tame these lava-forged giants.&r"
				""
				" &oHarness the inferno, channel the molten flow, and rise as the master of Nether-bound automation.&r"
			]
