		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Hidden high above the shadowed terrain of the &5Otherside&r lies a marvel unlike any other-&lthe Resonite Vent&r. This rare molten vent thrums with &omysterious energy&r and &buntapped potential&r."
				""
				"&lResonite&r is a resource like no other, vital for &ladvanced crafting&r and &6late-game progression&r. But claiming it won’t be easy. Navigating the Otherside's eerie depths is dangerous enough-but scaling to its uppermost reaches? That’s a challenge worthy of only the boldest adventurers."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Locating the Vent"
				"The Resonite Vent doesn’t appear in the open. You'll need to explore &5ancient ruins&r, brave the dimension’s warped geometry, and ascend its obsidian canopy to find this molten marvel."
				""
				" Activating the Pulse"
				"As with all Resource vents, activate it by feeding a blaze burner blaze cake atop its dormant form. Once awakened, feed it the required fluid-&oto be discovered on your journey&r-and unlock a renewable stream of Resonite materials."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Unravel the secrets. Claim the rewards."
				"Let the &mheartbeat of the Otherside&r guide your way into the arcane unknown."
				""
				" &oThe Resonite Vent awaits-do you have the resolve to reach it?&r"
			]
