		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Amid the Moon’s &7desolate craters&r and &7silent plains&r lies a rare celestial anomaly-the &lAubrum Vent&r. Embedded within the rugged lunar surface, this molten vent pulses with a faint &dcosmic shimmer&r, hinting at the powerful resource it contains."
				""
				"&6Aubrum&r is a crucial component in &lspace-age machinery&r and &6high-tier automation&r, making this vent an essential milestone in your interstellar progression. Only those bold enough to pierce the heavens and step onto the Moon will be able to harness its power."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Finding the Vent"
				"The Aubrum Vent is unique to the Moon and can be found nestled among the craters and &7regolith dust&r. Its glowing hue makes it easy to spot-if you're paying attention."
				""
				" Ignite the Process"
				"Activate the dormant vent by feeding blaze cake to a &lblaze burner&r atop it. Once it erupts into its awakened state, it will require a &ospecial liquid&r to begin producing the coveted Aubrum ore through your &lmechanical extruder&r setups."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Conquer the void, claim the shimmer."
				"Let &6Aubrum&r fuel your ascent into the stars!"
				""
				" &oThe Moon holds more than dust-it holds your future.&r"
			]
