		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Beneath the &4crimson dunes&r and jagged cliffs of Mars lies a discovery that redefines space-age engineering-the &lStellaris Vent&r. This molten fissure radiates with &dinterstellar energy&r, its glowing core a gateway to &6rare resources&r essential for your most advanced machines."
				""
				"Found only on the &4Martian surface&r, Stellaris Vents are your ticket to unlocking powerful components like &6Ostrum&r, pushing your technological frontier further than ever before."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Venture Across the Red World"
				"To locate a Stellaris Vent, you’ll need to brave Mars’s &cdust-choked plains&r and &7hostile terrain&r. Once discovered, feed a blaze burner blaze cake atop the vent to activate it, transforming it into a pulsing source of molten energy."
				""
				" Refined Power, Endless Potential"
				"Feed the awakened vent its &oliquid catalyst&r-crafted through resourceful engineering-and you’ll be able to automate &6Ostrum&r production using &lmechanical extruders&r."
