		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Amid the &cscorching storms&r and &6volcanic terrain&r of Venus lies a molten marvel-the &lPyroclast Vent&r. This superheated fissure pulses with &cfire-infused energy&r, radiating with volatile power and the promise of &6rare progression materials&r."
				""
				"Found exclusively on the &6surface of Venus&r, the Pyroclast Vent is not just a resource node-it’s a &ltrial by fire&r, offering &dCalorite potential&r to those resilient enough to endure the planet’s wrath."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Survive the Inferno"
				"Venus offers no mercy. With &4toxic skies&r and &corrosive heat&r, locating a Pyroclast Vent is only the beginning. Once uncovered, feed a blaze burner blaze cake atop the vent to activate it, converting it from dormant stone to a living conduit of molten power."
				""
				" Ignite Progression"
