		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Amid the &3glacial stillness&r of Glacio’s frozen surface lies a &bcrystalline wonder&r-the &lFrostite Vent&r. Nestled in the &9ice-locked terrain&r, this shimmering vent radiates with &owintry energy&r, offering an essential resource for those who brave the frost-covered frontiers."
				""
				"Found only in the &frozen heart of Glacio&r, the Frostite Vent is a &lcore component&r in the automation of powerful &bice-based alloys&r and high-tier machinery."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Awaken the Frozen Core"
				"Track its jagged, frost-lined spires among Glacio’s icy valleys. To activate the vent, feed a blaze burner blaze cake on its surface, shattering its dormant crust and awakening the &lflow of sub-zero energy&r beneath."
				""
				" Fuel the Chill"
				"Supply the vent with &bGlacio Ice Shard Milkshake&r, crafted from frigid shards found deep beneath the planet’s crust. Once activated, the &lMechanical Extruder&r will begin transforming fluid into &lvaluable Frostite Orestone&r."
