		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"The &5End Dimension&r holds more than the &odragon’s roar&r-it conceals &lthree mystical Resource vents&r, each pulsing with energy beyond comprehension. These ancient fissures, embedded within the alien stone of the End, offer resources as rare as they are powerful."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Radiantite Vent"
				"Glowing with &emystic brilliance&r, the Radiantite Vent is a &lbeacon of celestial energy&r. Found among the tall spires and windswept void islands, it fuels the most &radvanced crafting systems&r in the known universe."
				""
				" Void Shale Vent"
				"Dark and &koblivion-bound&r, this vent bleeds fragments of the &oinfinite void&r itself. Handle with caution-the &8Void Shale Vent&r pulses with power drawn from the edge of nothingness."
				""
				" Palerock Vent"
				"Smooth, pale, and deceptively silent, the Palerock Vent reflects the &7enigmatic stillness&r of the End. While less volatile than its counterparts, it provides &lessential resources&r for those seeking mastery over the End’s deeper secrets."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" How to Harness Their Power"
				"As with other Resource vents, feed a blaze burner blaze cake on top of it to awaken them from dormancy. Once activated, each requires a &lspecific custom milkshake&r fluid to begin automation via &lMechanical Extruders&r."
				""
				"&5Will you tame the void and command its power-or be lost to its depths?&r"
				"&dThe secrets of the End await those who dare to seek them.&r"
			]
