		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Deep beneath the crushing pressure of the Abyssal Chasm, where &9tube worms writhe&r and &omysterious ruins slumber&r, the &bPearlyte Vent&r glimmers with &ltreasures of the sea&r. This &luncommon molten vent&r is shrouded in bioluminescent glow and guarded by the perils of the deep."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Abyssal Location"
				"Accessible only to the &lbravest divers&r and most prepared explorers, this vent lies at the heart of &lAlex’s Caves: Abyssal Chasm&r. There, the ocean’s depth &odistorts sound and light&r, making orientation-and survival-a true challenge."
				""
				" Unlocking Its Power"
				"As with all Resource vents, feed a blaze burner blaze cake atop the &odormant Pearlyte&r to activate its core. Once awakened, it will accept a specific &aMilkshake Fluid&r, initiating a powerful resource generation process through your &lMechanical Extruder&r system."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Why It Matters"
				"Pearlyte fuels &ladvanced crafting recipes&r required for late-game engineering, machinery, and interdimensional travel. It’s a cornerstone of deep-sea industry and a prize for those bold enough to venture below."
				""
				" Will you master the tides-or vanish into the abyss?"
				" The ocean whispers secrets meant only for the daring…"
