			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"In the &0shadow-choked crevices&r of the &lForlorn Hollows&r, the &8Guanite Vent&r bubbles ominously from beneath the cursed &7Guanostone&r. Surrounded by the whispers of the &nforgotten dead&r and patrolled by the &cForsaken&r, this molten vent pulses with a &odark, forbidden energy&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" A Sinister Discovery"
				"This vent is found only in the depths of the &lAlex’s Caves: Forlorn Hollows&r-a biome steeped in &omalevolent energy&r and echoing with the cries of the &cUnderzealots&r. It is a realm not meant for the faint of heart."
				""
				" Activation Amid Shadows"
