		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"In the heart of the &2Toxic Caves&r, where the air stings with radiation and every breath carries risk, two volatile Resource vents await those with the resolve to survive: the &eSulphite Vent&r and the &aUraniumnite Vent&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" The Sulphite Vent"
				"&lBubbling with acidic fumes&r, this vent releases noxious materials that corrode unprotected tools and armor. Yet for the bold, its yield is vital for crafting chemical catalysts and energy-rich components."
				""
				" The Uraniumnite Vent"
				"&lPulsing with radioactive energy&r, this vent glows ominously beneath the surface, promising powerful-but dangerous-rewards. Handle with care, as extended exposure could mean disaster without the right gear."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" A World of Rot and Ruin"
				"These vents lie hidden among &lapocalyptic ruins&r and &ltoxic swamplands&r, surrounded by grotesque creatures twisted by radiation. Navigating this biome will test your endurance, preparation, and sanity."
				""
				" Activate and Automate"
				"As with all vents, feed a blaze burner blaze cake atop a dormant vent to awaken it. Then supply its &ldesignated milkshake fluid&r to begin extraction using &lMechanical Extruders&r. These vents are key to unlocking powerful recipes and technologies later in your journey."
				""
				" Will you brave the toxic storm and claim these corrosive riches-or become part of the wasteland?"
			]
