		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Deep within the &9Magnetic Caves&r, where polarity distorts reality and metal hums with unnatural energy, lie two of the most advanced Resource vents in existence: the &3Azurnium Vent&r and the &dNeodymrium Vent&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" The Azurnium Vent"
				"Gleaming with &lmechanical brilliance&r, this vent pulses with the &obrainpower of automation&r. It is said that Azurnium once powered lost machines of an ancient civilization-machines that could build themselves."
				""
				" The Neodymrium Vent"
				"Crackling with &omagnetic current&r, the Neodymrium Vent distorts compasses and draws metals to itself. Its rare energy signature is perfect for &lconductive alloys&r and &ltech-based contraptions&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" Harnessing Their Potential"
				"To awaken either vent, &6feed a blaze burner blaze cake&r atop a dormant version found in this volatile biome. Supply it with the &odesignated milkshake fluid&r and channel the output using &lMechanical Extruders&r to automate resource production."
				""
				" But Beware…"
				"The &cMagnetic Caves&r are home to &lTeletors&r, &lMagnetrons&r, and other magnetic horrors that will stop at nothing to defend the vents. Approach with caution-and a well-armored mech suit."
				""
				" Will you master the forces of magnetism, or fall victim to its pull?"
			]
			icon: "alexscaves:telecore"
			id: "42CE6455938E37CF"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 9
