		{
			dependencies: ["7AC47553B491EE76"]
			description: [
				"Deep within the enchanting yet unsettling realm of the &dCandy Cavity&r lies the &lLost Debris Vent&r-a sugary relic of ancient sweetness fused with galactic potential. This vent holds the key to automating &dLost Debris&r, which is later refined into the rare and powerful &5Ethium&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &lA Dessert with Depth&r"
				"The Candy Cavity may seem whimsical on the surface, but within its saccharine walls lurk challenges worthy of even the bravest explorers. The Lost Debris Vent is no exception-dormant, deceptive, and deliciously dangerous."
				""
				" &lActivate with a Blaze Cake&r"
				"Place a &oBlaze Cake&r atop a dormant Lost Debris Vent and ignite it using a &lBlaze Burner&r. This intense heat will awaken the vent, priming it for fluid-based automation."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &lFuel It with Pie Filling&r"
				"Once activated, supply the vent with &dChorus Fruit Pie Filling&r (covered in the next quest). Doing so will trigger &lMechanical Extruders&r to begin generating Lost Debris-your pathway to Ethium engineering."
				""
				" &oA tale of candy, combustion, and cosmic potential awaits...&r"
				"Will you master the cavity’s sweetness and claim the forgotten power sealed inside the Lost Debris Vent?"
			]
			icon: "alexscaves:small_peppermint"
			id: "77EB3AE60F0E8FEA"
			rewards: [
				{
					count: 9
					id: "70E6BD776C14DC1D"
					item: "alexscaves:cake_layer"
					type: "item"
				}
				{
					id: "10CAF3D8A46702E7"
					type: "xp"
					xp: 25
				}
			]
			shape: "hexagon"
			subtitle: "&oFueling Ethium automation with an otherworldly confection found only in the Candy Cavity!&r."
			tasks: [{
				dimension: "forge_frontier:candy_cavity"
