				"177FD83E945AE2BE"
			]
			description: [
				"&dRuby Chocolate&r is the &oultimate confection&r used to activate all three End Resource vents: &5Radiantite&r, &2Malachite&r, and &7Bismuth&r. It fuels the &omechanical extruder automation&r for each, making it a critical post-End fluid in your galactic progression."
				""
				"Unlike other chocolates, Ruby Chocolate is forged from rare and mystical ingredients-crafted only by those who have conquered the End and tamed its ancient power."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To craft it, you’ll need to &lHeated Mix&r the ingredients shown below-including &dDragon’s Breath&r, which can be automated post-End by placing a &5Dragon Head&r in front of an &bEncased Fan&r to convert Bottles into Breath."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/_create_confectionery_ruby_chocolate_recipe.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"&lThe End may be behind you, but its power flows forward&r-harness the sweetness of the void and turn chocolate into cosmic control! "
			]
			id: "17559ED0B5B300D9"
