		{
			dependencies: ["3B0CEEDC47C9AFAE"]
			description: [
				"Cheese serves as the &oessential fluid&r for activating &fAubrum Resource vents&r and powering &6Desh automation&r through mechanical extruders. Though it may sound simple, cheese production is a multi-step culinary-industrial process that starts with the zest of citrus and ends with a hearty dairy product ready for moon-fueled machines."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Your first step is to obtain &aLime Slices&r-tangy ingredients sourced from slicing limes using the method below:"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/_collectorsreap_cutting_lime.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Next, compress those slices into a zesty fluid. Compacting the lime slices will yield &aLime Juice&r, perfect for curdling milk into cheese."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_compacting_lime_juice.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Finally, combine the &aLime Juice&r with &fMilk&r using &lHeated Mixing&r to curdle it into &6Cheese&r-the final automation-ready product used in Aubrum’s molten processes."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mixing_cheese.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"&lFrom citrus to circuitry&r-Cheese turns your dairy dreams into lunar Desh dominance. "
			]
			id: "4DA4B3B5EC216D1B"
			rewards: [{
