		{
			dependencies: ["66C50363340B22B0"]
			description: [
				"&bCryo Fuel&r is the &oessential fluid&r for activating &dResonite Resource vents&r and fueling &bEcho Shard&r automation via &lMechanical Extruders&r. This frigid fuel is the result of a &oseven-step chemical process&r that blends bio-alchemy with molten synthesis."
				""
				"Your first step begins with producing &eSeed Oil&r through compacting:"
